@startuml
title Event Seq2Seq — research training workflow
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
folder "Simulator event cycles" as Data
[Cycle-level train / test split] as Split
[Encoder: BiLSTM] as Encoder
[Final hidden + cell states] as States
[Decoder: LSTM] as Decoder
[Dense output head] as Head
[Masked training & validation] as Evaluate
[Hyperparameter comparison] as Tune
database "Saved checkpoints / loss plots" as Results
Data --> Split
Split --> Encoder
Encoder --> States
States --> Decoder
Decoder --> Head
Head --> Evaluate
Evaluate --> Tune
Tune --> Results
note bottom of Decoder
Teacher forcing during training.
This is research model code,
not a live inference service.
end note
@enduml
